@@ -9,6 +9,9 @@ ## [Unreleased]
 
 ### Added
 
+- Session authentication with Livewire full-page components and Bulma: login, registration, logout, forgot/reset password, and e-mail verification.
+- Brazilian Portuguese (`pt_BR`) as the default product locale, with English (`en`) fallback and UI strings in `lang/*/ui.php`.
+- Login and registration rate limiting, strict e-mail validation, a shared password policy, and signed e-mail verification links.
 - Database schema and Mermaid diagram in [`docs/database-schema.md`](docs/database-schema.md).
 - Business rules documentation in [`docs/business-rules.md`](docs/business-rules.md): MVP queue management, entity/subscription, roles (admin, owner, employee), tickets, priorities, fairness (3-ticket rule), deterministic call panel, and channels (Flutter totem, web TV, attendant).
 - This changelog (Keep a Changelog).
